    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/63f7c10634c699e7186b462fb220ab95.avif?t=1751319424\" width=270 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A roguelike demonic combat game with deck-building where you must predict your enemy's moves to land your blows.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/02bb487d01e464f7e727001abceb722c.avif?t=1751319424\" width=251 height=140 /></span><br><strong><i>Fast-paced combat, numerous items and weapons to unleash powerful attacks, and unique effects that will turn the battle in your favor.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/b739dd3e27bc980bf700ecfed24c1a56.avif?t=1751319424\" width=240 height=130 /></span><br><strong><i>Unfold your strategy in the demonic arena with a huge variety of attacks that will change your game depending on which ones you choose.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/9db03c1d413f33ec07bb388d33cc3686.avif?t=1751319424\" width=240 height=130 /></span><br><strong><i>Set in a Japanese x Christian mythology, 75 Demons proposes a game where your concentration and intuition will be key to winning.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/b9a387278c5be9aa92addd60e9fda552.avif?t=1751319424\" width=421 height=270 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/63f7c10634c699e7186b462fb220ab95.avif?t=1751319424\" width=270 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>A roguelike demonic combat game with deck-building where you must predict your enemy's moves to land your blows.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/02bb487d01e464f7e727001abceb722c.avif?t=1751319424\" width=251 height=140 /></span><br><strong><i>Fast-paced combat, numerous items and weapons to unleash powerful attacks, and unique effects that will turn the battle in your favor.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/b739dd3e27bc980bf700ecfed24c1a56.avif?t=1751319424\" width=240 height=130 /></span><br><strong><i>Unfold your strategy in the demonic arena with a huge variety of attacks that will change your game depending on which ones you choose.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/9db03c1d413f33ec07bb388d33cc3686.avif?t=1751319424\" width=240 height=130 /></span><br><strong><i>Set in a Japanese x Christian mythology, 75 Demons proposes a game where your concentration and intuition will be key to winning.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787190/extras/b9a387278c5be9aa92addd60e9fda552.avif?t=1751319424\" width=421 height=270 /></span></p>",
